# S012503 candidate summary

`src/include/asm-generic/audit_write.rs` is a fresh source translation of the
pinned initializer fragment. It provides four exported consumer macros for
the frozen x86_64 native/IA32 and AArch64 native/AArch32-compat inclusion
contexts. Each expansion contains the preceding audit-directory entries and
the exact selected write syscall entries in upstream order; the AArch64 native
duplicate 32/64 syscall-number entries are preserved.
